sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Streamlit as Streamlit UI (app.py)
    participant Orchestrator as RAG Chain (src/rag_chain.py)
    participant Retriever as Hybrid Retriever (src/retrieval.py)
    participant VectorStore as ChromaDB (chroma_db/)
    participant BM25Store as In-Memory BM25
    participant GeminiClient as Gemini Client (src/gemini_client.py)
    participant GeminiAPI as Google Gemini API

    User->>Streamlit: Submit Question
    Streamlit->>Orchestrator: query(question, strategy, top_k)
    Orchestrator->>Retriever: retrieve(question, top_k=3)
    
    par Dual Candidate Retrieval
        Retriever->>VectorStore: similarity_search_with_score(k=10)
        VectorStore-->>Retriever: 10 Dense Candidates
    and
        Retriever->>BM25Store: get_top_n(tokens, n=10)
        BM25Store-->>Retriever: 10 Lexical Candidates
    end

    Retriever->>Retriever: Compute Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF k=60)
    Retriever-->>Orchestrator: Return Top 3 Fused Documents
    
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Build Grounded Prompt with Citations
    Orchestrator->>GeminiClient: generate_response(prompt, temperature=0.0)
    GeminiClient->>GeminiAPI: generate_content(model="gemini-3.7-flash")
    GeminiAPI-->>GeminiClient: Raw Generated Text
    GeminiClient-->>Orchestrator: Text Response
    
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Format Output (Answer + 3 Source Cards)
    Orchestrator-->>Streamlit: Return Structured JSON Response
    Streamlit-->>User: Render Grounded Answer & Source Cards
